  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-5cc6fc78-7fff-5f97-f7c0-9c26bcc9b9a5&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed roof extensions by reason of their design, size, scale, bulk, and location, would be out of character with the host property, and the terrace it forms part of, resulting in a detrimental impact on the visual amenities of the locality and the terrace it forms part of. It would therefore be contrary to policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character)  and LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020), policy D4 (Delivering good design) of the London Plan (2021), and Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
